---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Layout>
<main class="custom"><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMIZE / 01—05</p><h1>Build your<br /><i>second life.</i></h1><p class="intro">Select the original emblem, then define the details that make the finished piece yours.</p>
<div class="panel"><label>01 / BRAND<select><option>Select a marque</option><option>BMW</option><option>Mercedes-Benz</option><option>Porsche</option><option>Land Rover</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>02 / MODEL<input placeholder="Model name" /></label><label>03 / YEAR<input placeholder="Model year / generation" /></label><label>04 / POSITION<select><option>Front grille</option><option>Rear</option><option>Steering wheel</option><option>Wheel centre</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>05 / FINISH<select><option>Classic enamel</option><option>Deep black</option><option>Ivory</option><option>Custom colour</option></select></label><a href="/signature" class="next">CONTINUE TO PERSONALISATION ↗</a></div></main>
</Layout>
<style>
:global(body){background:#f3f1eb;color:#151515;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.custom{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:12vw 7vw}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;opacity:.55}.custom h1{font-size:clamp(64px,9vw,130px);font-weight:400;line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:70px 0 35px}.custom h1 i{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400}.intro{font-size:19px;max-width:500px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.65}.panel{margin-top:90px;border-top:1px solid #aaa;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 60px}.panel label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #bbb}.panel select,.panel input{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #888;background:transparent;padding:18px 0;font-size:18px;margin-top:12px;outline:none}.next{grid-column:1/-1;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #111;padding:25px 0;margin-top:35px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em}@media(max-width:700px){.panel{grid-template-columns:1fr}.next{grid-column:auto}.custom{padding:22vw 8vw}}
</style>